<title>NETHERLANDS: BEERS FIRST-HALF NET UP SIX PCT.</title>
<headline>BEERS FIRST-HALF NET UP SIX PCT.</headline>
<dateline>LEIDSCHENDAM, Netherlands 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    20.8  vs  19.6</p>
<p>    Total turnover			 0.48 vs   0.39</p>
<p>Note - Truckmaker Beers said full-year net profit was</p>
<p>expected to at least equal or be slightly higher than the 38.9</p>
<p>million guilders of the 'very good' 1995. The company said in</p>
<p>May it expected first-half net profits at least equal to the</p>
<p>year-earlier 19.6 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
